OL,3,GNEWSARugby club celebrates 'strongest'
OL,4,Afinancial year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rugby club in the region has reported
OL,7,Fits most commercially successful season
OL,8,Fin a decade after delivering a record
OL,9,Fturnover of #26.9m.
OL,11,FNorthampton Saints said turnover
OL,12,Fincreased by #3.4m for the year ending
OL,13,FJune 2026, compared with the previous
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FAnnouncing its financial results on
OL,17,FTuesday, the club said the success was
OL,18,Fdriven by strong ticket, retail and
OL,19,Fhospitality sales, as well as success
OL,20,Fon the pitch.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
